  // here: the document closed (its `</html>` is present), and it is the size
  // of a settings page. That page measured 501,773 characters on 2026-08-17,
  // so this floor sits an order of magnitude under it and rejects a login
  // stub or an error page without resting on a size SharePoint owns.
